      2 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قنّأ</span></b> , (S, O, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقْنِئَةٌ</span>, (S, O,) or
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَقْنِىْءٌ</span>, (K,) <i>He rendered</i> (S, O, K) a thing, (K,)
or his beard, (S, O,) <i>intensely red</i> (S, O, * K)
with dye. (S, O.) And <i>He dyed his beard
black;</i> as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَنَأَ</span></b> . (K.)

